  "description": "After thousands watch his messy breakup stream, Simon goes from star streamer to heartbroken social outcast. But everything changes when Rina, a curious runaway android who looks exactly like his favorite VTuber, gives him a brain-rewiring kiss that turns his reality into a living dating sim. Suddenly, Simon is hunted down by lethal agents and assassins seeking to recapture the state-of-the-art bot. Now forced to use \"date triggers\" to survive these high-stakes encounters, Simon must protect Rina while rediscovering what love really means. In this Romcom Survival Dating Experience, it’s Date, or Die!\n\n*Source: Webtoon*",
